  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, $P(H)=\\frac{1}{2}, P(T)=\\frac{1}{2}$ \r\nNow, $P(X \\geq 1)=1-P(X=0$\r\n$=1-{ }^{n} C_{o}(p)^{0}(q)^{n}=1-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}$\r\n$1-\\frac{1}{2^{n}} \\geq 0.9$\r\n$\\Rightarrow$\r\n$0.1 \\geq \\frac{1}{2 n}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow$\r\n$\\frac{1}{10} \\geq \\frac{1}{2^{n}}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow$\r\n$z^{n} \\geq 10$\r\n$\\Rightarrow$\r\n$n \\geq 4$\r\nMinimum number of tossed = 4",
